  "prefLabel": "Plc 702.17 Plan of correction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 702.17 “Plan of correction” means a written representation of a revised policy or practice that reflects how an electrologist will correct a violation of, and come into compliance with, Plc 700 or RSA 314 or such analogous requirements as apply in the jurisdiction asked to provide confirmation of good standing.\n\nSource. #13495, eff 12-22-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 700)",
